</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Ye saints redeemed from Adam’s race,</l><l>Ye ransomed from the fall,</l><l>Hail Him who saves you by His grace,</l><l>And crown Him Lord of all.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Tell forth the only Name that’s giv’n</l><l>On which we now may call,</l><l>The Name adored by hosts in heav’n,</l><l>And crown Him Lord of all.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
